{%- comment -%}
  Page collection MOBILE (prototype « platinumshop-collection-mobile ») — zone au-dessus de la grille, rendue par
  sections/main-collection.liquid. Données réelles : titre et nombre de produits, sous-collections du menu (réglage
  « Menu des filtres » de la section), filtres Search & Discovery (collection.filters), tris Shopify (collection.sort_options).
  Filtres et tri rechargent la page avec les paramètres Shopify (filter.*, sort_by) ; la grille reste celle du thème
  (cartes produit + chargement automatique, assets/mobile-auto-load.js).
  Affiché seulement en mobile (assets/collection-mobile.css) ; script : assets/collection-mobile.js.
  Params : section, menu (linklist des sous-collections)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign clm_sort = collection.sort_by | default: collection.default_sort_by
  assign clm_sort_label = ''
  for option in collection.sort_options
    if option.value == clm_sort
      assign clm_sort_label = option.name
    endif
  endfor

  assign clm_active_count = 0
  for filter in collection.filters
    if filter.type == 'price_range'
      if filter.min_value.value != nil or filter.max_value.value != nil
        assign clm_active_count = clm_active_count | plus: 1
      endif
    else
      assign clm_active_count = clm_active_count | plus: filter.active_values.size
    endif
  endfor

  assign clm_clear_url = collection.url
  if collection.sort_by != blank
    assign clm_clear_url = collection.url | append: '?sort_by=' | append: collection.sort_by
  endif

  # Sous-collections : lien du menu de la collection (ses enfants), sinon lien parent (ses frères).
  assign clm_parent = nil
  assign clm_children = nil
  for link in menu.links
    if link.url == collection.url and link.links.size > 0
      assign clm_parent = link
    endif
    for child in link.links
      if child.url == collection.url
        if child.links.size > 0
          assign clm_parent = child
        else
          assign clm_parent = link
        endif
      endif
      for grandchild in child.links
        if grandchild.url == collection.url
          assign clm_parent = child
        endif
      endfor
    endfor
  endfor
-%}
<style>.clm{display:none}</style>
<div class="clm" data-collection-mobile data-total="{{ collection.products_count }}">
  <nav class="clm-bc" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.cart.breadcrumb' | t }}">
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">{{ 'mobile.cart.home' | t }}</a>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"/></svg>
    <span aria-current="page">{{ collection.title }}</span>
  </nav>
  <div class="clm-title">
    <h1>{{ collection.title }}</h1>
    <p>
      {%- if collection.products_count == 1 -%}
        {{ 'mobile.collection.count_one' | t }}
      {%- else -%}
        {{ 'mobile.collection.count_other_html' | t: count: collection.products_count }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </p>
  </div>

  {%- if clm_parent != nil and clm_parent.links.size > 0 -%}
    <nav class="clm-cats" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.subcategories' | t }}">
      <a href="{{ clm_parent.url }}"{% if clm_parent.url == collection.url %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}>{{ 'mobile.collection.all' | t }}</a>
      {%- for child in clm_parent.links -%}
        <a href="{{ child.url }}"{% if child.url == collection.url %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}>{{ child.title }}</a>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </nav>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="clm-tb" data-clm-toolbar>
    {%- if collection.filters.size > 0 -%}
      <button class="clm-f{% if clm_active_count > 0 %} is-on{% endif %}" type="button" data-clm-open="filters" aria-haspopup="dialog">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h10M18 7h2M4 17h2M10 17h10"/><circle cx="16" cy="7" r="2.2"/><circle cx="8" cy="17" r="2.2"/></svg>
        {{- 'mobile.collection.filters' | t -}}
        {%- if clm_active_count > 0 %}<span class="clm-badge">{{ clm_active_count }}</span>{% endif -%}
      </button>
    {%- endif -%}
    <button class="clm-s" type="button" data-clm-open="sort" aria-haspopup="dialog">
      <svg class="clm-s__ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14M4.5 15.5 8 19l3.5-3.5M16 19V5m-3.5 3.5L16 5l3.5 3.5"/></svg>
      <span>{% if clm_sort_label != blank %}{{ clm_sort_label | escape }}{% else %}{{ 'mobile.collection.sort' | t }}{% endif %}</span>
      <svg class="clm-s__cv" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="clm-seg" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.view' | t }}">
      <button type="button" data-clm-view="2" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.two_cols' | t }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="4" width="7" height="7" rx="1.8"/><rect x="13" y="4" width="7" height="7" rx="1.8"/><rect x="4" y="13" width="7" height="7" rx="1.8"/><rect x="13" y="13" width="7" height="7" rx="1.8"/></svg></button>
      <button type="button" data-clm-view="1" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.one_col' | t }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="7" rx="1.8"/><rect x="4" y="13" width="16" height="7" rx="1.8"/></svg></button>
    </div>
    {%- comment -%}
      Raccourcis (prototype « Filtri v2 ») : « Disponibili » s'applique d'un toucher ; les autres ouvrent la feuille
      directement sur leur filtre. Vrais filtres de la collection, dans l'ordre de Search & Discovery.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if collection.filters.size > 0 -%}
      <div class="clm-qf" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.quick_filters' | t }}">
        {%- for filter in collection.filters -%}
          {%- if filter.param_name == 'filter.v.availability' -%}
            {%- for value in filter.values -%}
              {%- if value.value == '1' -%}
                <a class="clm-qf__av{% if value.active %} is-on{% endif %}" href="{% if value.active %}{{ value.url_to_remove }}{% else %}{{ value.url_to_add }}{% endif %}"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>{{ 'mobile.collection.available' | t }}</a>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign clm_filter_active = 0
              if filter.type == 'price_range'
                if filter.min_value.value != nil or filter.max_value.value != nil
                  assign clm_filter_active = 1
                endif
              else
                assign clm_filter_active = filter.active_values.size
              endif
            -%}
            <button type="button" class="{% if clm_filter_active > 0 %}is-on{% endif %}" data-clm-open="filters" data-clm-section="{{ forloop.index }}">
              {{- filter.label | escape -}}
              {%- if clm_filter_active > 0 -%}
                <b>{{ clm_filter_active }}</b>
              {%- else -%}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
              {%- endif -%}
            </button>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- if clm_active_count > 0 -%}
    <div class="clm-act">
      {%- for filter in collection.filters -%}
        {%- if filter.type == 'price_range' -%}
          {%- if filter.min_value.value != nil or filter.max_value.value != nil -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign clm_min = filter.min_value.value | default: 0 | money_without_trailing_zeros
              assign clm_max = filter.max_value.value | default: filter.range_max | money_without_trailing_zeros
            -%}
            <a class="clm-chip" href="{{ filter.url_to_remove }}" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.remove_filter' | t }}: {{ filter.label | escape }}">
              {{- clm_min }} – {{ clm_max -}}
              <span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg></span>
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- for value in filter.active_values -%}
            <a class="clm-chip" href="{{ value.url_to_remove }}" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.remove_filter' | t }}: {{ value.label | escape }}">
              {{- value.label | escape -}}
              <span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg></span>
            </a>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      <a class="clm-clr" href="{{ clm_clear_url }}">{{ 'mobile.collection.clear_all' | t }}</a>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} « Mostrando N di T prodotti » : N suit les produits chargés (chargement automatique), par le script. {%- endcomment -%}
  <p class="clm-res" data-clm-results hidden></p>

  {%- comment -%}
    Feuille Filtri v2 (prototype « Filtri v2 ») : vrais filtres Search & Discovery dans l'ordre de l'app.
    Disponibilità en interrupteur, Prezzo en double curseur (échelle non linéaire, max réel de la collection),
    listes en accordéons (recherche + « Mostra altre » pour les longues listes, grille pour tailles / pointures,
    pastilles pour les couleurs). Le bouton « Mostra N prodotti » est recalculé par Shopify à chaque changement
    (assets/collection-mobile.js) ; la validation recharge la page filtrée.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if collection.filters.size > 0 -%}
    <section class="clm-sheet clm-fsheet" data-clm-sheet="filters" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.filters' | t }}" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="clm-grab" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="clm-sh">
        <h4>{{ 'mobile.collection.filters' | t }}<span class="clm-fc" data-clm-fcount hidden>0</span></h4>
        <div class="clm-sh-r">
          <button class="clm-clrlink" type="button" data-clm-reset>{{ 'mobile.collection.reset' | t }}</button>
          <button class="clm-sx" type="button" data-clm-close aria-label="{{ 'mobile.common.close' | t }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="clm-fsel" data-clm-fsel aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.selected' | t }}" hidden></div>
      <form class="clm-form" action="{{ collection.url }}" method="get" data-clm-filter-form data-section-id="{{ section.id }}" data-clear-url="{{ clm_clear_url }}" data-applied="{{ clm_active_count }}">
        {%- if collection.sort_by != blank -%}<input type="hidden" name="sort_by" value="{{ collection.sort_by | escape }}">{%- endif -%}
        <div class="clm-sb">
          {%- for filter in collection.filters -%}
            {%- if filter.param_name == 'filter.v.availability' -%}
              {%- comment -%} Disponibilità : un seul interrupteur « disponibles » (valeur 1). {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- for value in filter.values -%}
                {%- if value.value == '1' -%}
                  <label class="clm-frow" data-clm-sec="{{ forloop.parentloop.index }}">
                    <input type="checkbox" name="{{ value.param_name }}" value="1"{% if value.active %} checked{% endif %} data-clm-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.available' | t | escape }}">
                    <span class="clm-frow__tx"><b>{{ filter.label | escape }}</b><small>{{ 'mobile.collection.only_available' | t }} ({{ value.count }})</small></span>
                    <span class="clm-frow__t" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  </label>
                {%- elsif value.active -%}
                  <input type="hidden" name="{{ value.param_name }}" value="{{ value.value | escape }}">
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            {%- else -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign clm_kind = 'list'
                if filter.type == 'price_range'
                  assign clm_kind = 'price'
                elsif filter.presentation == 'swatch'
                  assign clm_kind = 'swatch'
                else
                  assign clm_kind = 'chips'
                  for value in filter.values
                    if value.label.size > 6
                      assign clm_kind = 'list'
                      break
                    endif
                  endfor
                endif
                assign clm_open = false
                if clm_kind == 'price'
                  assign clm_open = true
                endif
              -%}
              <div class="clm-fsec" data-clm-sec="{{ forloop.index }}" data-clm-kind="{{ clm_kind }}">
                <button type="button" class="clm-fh" aria-expanded="{{ clm_open }}" data-clm-acc>
                  <span class="clm-fh__t">{{ filter.label | escape }}</span>
                  <span class="clm-fh__v" data-clm-summary></span>
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="clm-fp"><div{% unless clm_open %} inert{% endunless %}><div class="clm-fp__in">
                  {%- case clm_kind -%}
                    {%- when 'price' -%}
                      {%- liquid
                        assign clm_currency = cart.currency.symbol | default: '€'
                        assign clm_range_max = filter.range_max | divided_by: 100.0 | ceil
                      -%}
                      <div class="clm-hist" data-clm-hist aria-hidden="true"></div>
                      <div class="clm-rng" data-clm-range data-max="{{ clm_range_max }}">
                        <div class="clm-rng__tr"><div class="clm-rng__fl" data-clm-fill></div></div>
                        <input type="range" min="0" max="1000" value="0" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.price_min' | t }}" data-clm-rmin>
                        <input type="range" min="0" max="1000" value="1000" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.price_max' | t }}" data-clm-rmax>
                      </div>
                      <div class="clm-price">
                        <label>{{ clm_currency }}<input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" name="{{ filter.min_value.param_name }}" value="{% if filter.min_value.value %}{% assign clm_cents = filter.min_value.value | modulo: 100 %}{% if clm_cents == 0 %}{{ filter.min_value.value | divided_by: 100 }}{% else %}{{ filter.min_value.value | divided_by: 100.0 }}{% endif %}{% endif %}" placeholder="0" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.price_min' | t }}" data-clm-min></label>
                        <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <label>{{ clm_currency }}<input type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" name="{{ filter.max_value.param_name }}" value="{% if filter.max_value.value %}{% assign clm_cents = filter.max_value.value | modulo: 100 %}{% if clm_cents == 0 %}{{ filter.max_value.value | divided_by: 100 }}{% else %}{{ filter.max_value.value | divided_by: 100.0 }}{% endif %}{% endif %}" placeholder="{{ clm_range_max }}" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.price_max' | t }}" data-clm-max></label>
                      </div>
                      <div class="clm-pills">
                        {%- assign clm_ranges = '0-10,10-25,25-50,50-100,100-' | split: ',' -%}
                        {%- for range in clm_ranges -%}
                          {%- liquid
                            assign clm_from = range | split: '-' | first
                            assign clm_to = range | split: '-' | last
                            assign clm_from_label = clm_from | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros
                            assign clm_to_label = clm_to | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros
                          -%}
                          <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-clm-range-min="{% if clm_from != '0' %}{{ clm_from }}{% endif %}" data-clm-range-max="{% unless forloop.last %}{{ clm_to }}{% endunless %}">
                            {%- if forloop.first -%}
                              {{ 'mobile.collection.up_to_html' | t: amount: clm_to_label }}
                            {%- elsif forloop.last -%}
                              {{ 'mobile.collection.over_html' | t: amount: clm_from_label }}
                            {%- else -%}
                              {{ clm_from_label }} – {{ clm_to_label }}
                            {%- endif -%}
                          </button>
                        {%- endfor -%}
                      </div>
                      <p class="clm-phint" data-clm-phint hidden></p>
                    {%- when 'swatch' -%}
                      <div class="clm-sws">
                        {%- for value in filter.values -%}
                          <label class="clm-sw{% if value.count == 0 and value.active == false %} is-empty{% endif %}">
                            <input type="checkbox" name="{{ value.param_name }}" value="{{ value.value | escape }}"{% if value.active %} checked{% endif %}{% if value.count == 0 and value.active == false %} disabled{% endif %} data-clm-label="{{ value.label | escape }}">
                            <i style="{% if value.swatch.image %}background-image: url('{{ value.swatch.image | image_url: width: 80 }}');{% elsif value.swatch.color %}background: {{ value.swatch.color }};{% endif %}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></i>
                            <span>{{ value.label | escape }}</span>
                            <small data-clm-count>{{ value.count }}</small>
                          </label>
                        {%- endfor -%}
                      </div>
                    {%- when 'chips' -%}
                      <div class="clm-chips">
                        {%- for value in filter.values -%}
                          {%- assign clm_value_label = value.label -%}
                          {%- assign clm_value_down = value.label | downcase | strip -%}
                          {%- if clm_value_down == 'tu' or clm_value_down == 'taglia unica' or clm_value_down == 'one size' -%}{%- assign clm_value_label = 'mobile.collection.one_size' | t -%}{%- endif -%}
                          <label class="clm-chp{% if value.count == 0 and value.active == false %} is-empty{% endif %}">
                            <input type="checkbox" name="{{ value.param_name }}" value="{{ value.value | escape }}"{% if value.active %} checked{% endif %}{% if value.count == 0 and value.active == false %} disabled{% endif %} data-clm-label="{{ clm_value_label | escape }}">
                            <span>{{ clm_value_label | escape }}</span>
                            <small data-clm-count>{{ value.count }}</small>
                          </label>
                        {%- endfor -%}
                      </div>
                    {%- else -%}
                      {%- if filter.values.size > 7 -%}
                        <label class="clm-fsrch">
                          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg>
                          <input type="search" placeholder="{{ 'mobile.collection.search_in' | t: label: filter.label | escape }}" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.search_in' | t: label: filter.label | escape }}" data-clm-search autocomplete="off">
                        </label>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      <div class="clm-cks" data-clm-list>
                        {%- for value in filter.values -%}
                          <label class="clm-ck{% if value.count == 0 and value.active == false %} is-empty{% endif %}" data-clm-row>
                            <input type="checkbox" name="{{ value.param_name }}" value="{{ value.value | escape }}"{% if value.active %} checked{% endif %}{% if value.count == 0 and value.active == false %} disabled{% endif %} data-clm-label="{{ value.label | escape }}">
                            <span class="clm-ck__bx" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></span>
                            <span class="clm-ck__l" data-clm-text>{{ value.label | escape }}</span>
                            <span class="clm-ck__n" data-clm-count>{{ value.count }}</span>
                          </label>
                        {%- endfor -%}
                        <p class="clm-fnone" data-clm-none hidden></p>
                      </div>
                      {%- if filter.values.size > 7 -%}
                        <button type="button" class="clm-more" aria-expanded="false" data-clm-more data-count="{{ filter.values.size | minus: 7 }}"></button>
                      {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endcase -%}
                </div></div></div>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <div class="clm-sf">
          <button class="clm-c" type="button" data-clm-reset>{{ 'mobile.collection.clear' | t }}</button>
          <button class="clm-p" type="submit" data-clm-show>{{ 'mobile.collection.show_results' | t }}</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Feuille Ordina per : tris Shopify (noms déjà dans la langue du visiteur). {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="clm-sheet" data-clm-sheet="sort" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.collection.sort_title' | t }}" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="clm-grab" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="clm-sh">
      <h4>{{ 'mobile.collection.sort_title' | t }}</h4>
      <button class="clm-sx" type="button" data-clm-close aria-label="{{ 'mobile.common.close' | t }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg></button>
    </div>
    <ul class="clm-so" role="radiogroup">
      {%- for option in collection.sort_options -%}
        <li>
          <button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="{% if option.value == clm_sort %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" data-clm-sort="{{ option.value | escape }}">
            {{- option.name | escape -}}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg>
          </button>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </section>
  <div class="clm-scrim" data-clm-scrim hidden></div>
</div>
